  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'BLACK MOON (Dark, the ''orb'' form)

    A slow orb follows the nearest enemy and bursts on it. Strike the orb yourself and it bursts at once, larger.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Hold Triangle (U) to cast. 30 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 1068849779}
  text: {fileID: 354082391}
  back: {fileID: 1884424718}
  shown: {fileID: 1545273055}
  lineHeight: 0.17
  letterWidth: 0.075
